7VtePbAe_DMvEa24MGE91QwWAg3S9gVvGs84g3mL8Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4EOdLqnB_k5y2lNVysqu9WnyjmPnIn7I7nXjq8RoQo3A&oe=6A16F6B3"}, {"file_name": "Final5.png", "id": "1109469673205956", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031326_1109469676539289_4268533616333460252_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GHtSETdvECIQ7kNvwHns55q&_nc_oc=AdqI5S386rlSKvPQSlxdQMEoobn-fyXNtHDfISOJK3WRWb49Ob2nZ6_WxR23Kgtag-M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5MfI99YV68nu_i4NRI3MXfViQc7ejkUU5dKEP9d-2JEw&oe=6A16F537"}, {"file_name": "Final2.png", "id": "916532898880837", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003274_916532902214170_6367672695544734699_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w4BhctYuYYkQ7kNvwHoCpQa&_nc_oc=AdpvuD2LuLT-kRg3H-GYbKU-A65-DSzzuXSB5blUo7IkHG6tRVYD7ptzv5y0pa9eIQ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af74IlIR4PVsdCPYAvks0VqUIIgIoYImTJ8kAmCZCavCtw&oe=6A16E53A"}, {"file_name": "Final3.png", "id": "1165340330878993", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_1165340334212326_9147485654240656059_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bFi_V2jJBG4Q7kNvwE-irrs&_nc_oc=AdpIEyexL0RKHmPFIrfebDuOjBI9VI_v7xc7c-x6xIzlG2858pFFVajaSMo5EOytqWM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7Yc5hGVtOGGUo_FFW54oBCaGn6ByqvWy6MkUjK4ugBrw&oe=6A16F847"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Light Up The Dark", "keywords": [], "long_description": "*  Finger Controls.  \"Play\" the fireworks with your right-hand fingers using individual fingers and \"chords\" of fingers to fire different types of fire works.\n*  The Color Ball.  Your left hand is the color ball, moving side-to-side changes the color of the firework, and up/down adjusts the size of the fireworks blasts.\n*  Seamlessly switch between hands and controllers (with a hardware delay).\n*  Play reclined or laying down!  Or upside down.  Any position, any space.\n*  Environmental features such as snow, falling leaves, fireflies, and bubbles.  Seriously, try the bubbles.\n*  Listen to various audio tracks including a gentle Mozart piece, a Sousa March, and Wagner's Ride of the Valkyries, adjustable volumes for music and fireworks.\n*  Set the weather and the Speed of Time.  Note, the weather has a mind of its own.  \n*  Show and hide individual UI components or enter the VOID, with no user interface other than the finger streaks.\n\nShow and hide individual UI components or enter the ", "short_description": "Light Up The Dark is an exciting firework experience featuring a highly customizable atmosphere and snowman modes for casual or gaming fun.  Advanced controls using fingers and hands provide a unique experience.\n\nEnjoy a zen world with a light snow and the sounds of the forest at night, with fireworks.  \n\n\u200bOr bend time so a day lasts a few seconds, with a Sousa march fillings your ears while snowmen crash any sense of tranquility, with fireworks.\n\nYour fireworks.  Your way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.lightupthedarkgame.com/credits-legal", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Destroy Technology", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.LightUpTheDarkGame.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING